flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Access the impound lot and steal the sheikh&#39;s luxury vehicle."])
 _A1_(["Having accessed the impound lot, Car Thief spots the sheikh&#39;s supercar."])
 _A1_1_(["The high-value cars sit in a fenced area, a shipping container blocking the entrance."])
 _A1_2_(["The forklift can handle it but the team needs to acquire the car’s key fob first."])
 _A1_3_(["Peeking into the impound office, Car Thief spots the key cabinet on the far wall."])
 _A1_C1_{"Picklock tries to crack the lock with his lockpicks."}
 _A1_C1F_["Picklock fails to open the lock and spits on the ground in frustration."]
 _A1_4_(["Tired of Picklock&#39;s clumsiness, Muscle pushes him aside to take over."])
 _A1_C2_{"Muscle uses brute force and attempts to smash the door down."}
 _A1_C2P_["The door gives way after a few swift kicks, allowing the team to enter."]
 _A2_(["Car Thief presses the key fob and the supercar lights up with a beep."])
 _A2_1_(["The noise alerts a guard, forcing the team to hide in the office."])
 _A2_2_(["Sensing danger, Imitator steps out to delay the guard."])
 _A2_C1_{"Imitator flashes his cop badge, demanding help with his investigation."}
 _A2_C1F_["The guard bypasses Imitator, telling him he saw trespassers in the office."]
 _A2_3_(["Imitator pretends to look outside while the guard searches the room."])
 _A2_C2_{"Muscle tries to draw the guard out by striking a truck with a rock."}
 _A2_C2P_["The guard heads out and Imitator intercepts him, claiming there&#39;s nobody there."]
 _A2_6_(["Imitator&#39;s delaying tactics allow the team to escape the office."])
 _A3_(["Imitator requests access to a nearby truck, citing a development in an open case."])
 _A3_3_(["With the guards occupied, the team sets about moving the shipping container."])
 _A3_C1_{"Car Thief climbs into the forklift&#39;s cabin and starts the engine."}
 _A3_C1P_["Car Thief guides the forks into the lift pockets, moving the container clear."]
 _A4_(["The gate is found to be secured with a hefty padlock."])
 _A4_C1_{"Picklock pulls out his lockpicks and tries to get the gate open."}
 _A4_C1P_["Picklock&#39;s skill is evident as he makes quick work of the padlock."]
 _A5_(["Entering the fenced area, it&#39;s clear that the target car is boxed in by another vehicle."])
 _A5_1_(["Lifting from the front, the team shifts the car backward one step at a time."])
 _A5_2_(["The car is accidentally shunted into a neighboring vehicle, triggering its alarm."])
 _A5_3_(["Recognizing their blunder, the team scatters and hides as the guards approach."])
 _A5_C1_{"Muscle is almost discovered and has to sneak around a car to evade detection."}
 _A5_C1F_["Muscle finds his path blocked and is discovered by security."]
 _A5_C2_{"Imitator pulls rank and orders the guard to release the intruder."}
 _A5_C2F_["The guard resists and starts an argument, before radioing for his colleague."]
 _A5_5_(["Muscle and Imitator provoke the guards, drawing them out of the pen."])
 _A5_6_(["As their teammates brawl, Picklock and Car Thief rush to the car."])
 _A8_R3_(["Car Thief tries to leave but there&#39;s no one there to pull the gate aside."])
 _A8S_(["Unwilling to wait, Car Thief crashes through, leaving half the team behind."])
 _A2_C2F_["The guard doesn&#39;t notice the noise and continues searching inside the office."]
 _A2_C3_{"Imitator imposes his authority, commanding the guard to step outside."}
 _A2_C3P_["The guard bows to the demand and reluctantly leaves the office."]
 _A2_7_(["With the coast clear, Picklock and Car Thief are finally able to escape."])
 _A3_C1F_["Car Thief fails to guide the forklift accurately, crashing into the container."]
 _A3_4_(["The teammates quickly conceal themselves as the guards rush to the source of the noise."])
 _A3_5_(["Imitator tells the guards to hold back while he calls for backup."])
 _A3_C2_{"With the area clear, Muscle climbs aboard the forklift to move the container."}
 _A3_C2P_["Muscle slides the forks into the container&#39;s lift pockets and moves it clear."]
 _A3_7_(["Upon inspecting the newly accessible gate, Picklock finds it padlocked."])
 _A4_1_(["Tired of waiting, Muscle enters the forklift and tells her teammates to move."])
 _A4_C3_{"In her haste, Muscle struggles to control the forklift and almost topples."}
 _A4_C3F_["The forklift veers sharply to the right, slamming into Picklock."]
 _A4_2_(["The team rushes to aid Picklock, finding the side of his head caved in."])
 _A4_3_(["Distracted by the gory scene, they are surprised by the advancing security guards."])
 _A4F_(["The team is left with no choice but to abandon Picklock and make its escape."])
 _A4_C1F_["Picklock fails to crack the padlock, wedging a pick in the mechanism."]
 _A4_C2_{"Angry at Picklock&#39;s ineptitude, Car Thief steps in to help."}
 _A4_C2F_["Car Thief fails to open the lock, leaving the team frustrated."]
 _A4_C3P_["Regaining control, Muscle rams the gate open."]
 _A4_5_(["The guards are alerted by the noise, forcing Imitator to feign surprise."])
 _A4_5_Cont_(["Meanwhile, the others find a vehicle blocking their way out of the fenced area."])
 _B1_(["He concludes they&#39;ll have to move the offending vehicle by hand."])
 _B1_1_(["They try to heft the vehicle backward but the handbrake makes it difficult."])
 _B1_2_(["Muscle uses a pipe to break through the window, triggering the car&#39;s alarm."])
 _B1_C1_{"Sensing a threat, Imitator stalls the guards, insisting he alone should investigate."}
 _B1_C1F_["The guards realize something is amock and rush toward the luxury vehicle pen."]
 _B1_3_(["Seeing the guards approach, Picklock slams the gate and holds it shut."])
 _B1_4_(["Muscle reaches through the car&#39;s broken window and releases the handbrake."])
 _B1_5_(["The team shifts the vehicle just as the guards barge through."])
 _B1_C2_{"Picklock and Muscle try to fend off security with brute force."}
 _B1_C2F_["The guards make light work of the team, knocking them down in seconds."]
 _B1_6_(["Car Thief is dragged from the vehicle, his face slammed into the dirt."])
 _B1F_(["With the team subdued, Imitator hurries away to avoid capture."])
 _A4_C2P_["Car Thief wiggles the pick free, reinserts it, and is able to remove the padlock."]
 _A4_4_(["Car Thief assesses the situation and realizes there&#39;s a car blocking the exit route."])
 _B1_C2P_["As his teammates brawl with the guards, Car Thief starts the car&#39;s engine."]
 _B3_(["Car Thief turns on the car&#39;s high beams, blinding everyone in the vicinity."])
 _B3_1_(["As they all flail about, Picklock downs one guard but is knocked out brawling with the other."])
 _B3_2_(["Spotting an opening, Car Thief plows the car into the guard, crushing him."])
 _B3S_(["Picklock is helped up and the team speeds off in the stolen vehicle."])
 _B1_C1P_["Imitator holds the guards up long enough for the team to move the car."]
 _B2_(["With the guards approaching, Muscle runs out screaming to delay them further."])
 _B2_1_(["When the car crashes through the gate, Muscle is flung aside by the impact."])
 _B2S_(["Prioritizing their prize, the team drives off, leaving Muscle behind."])
 _A1_C1P_["Picklock picks the lock, granting entry to the office."]
 _A2_C1P_["The guard buys Imitator&#39;s story, allowing the others to continue their mission."]
 _A5_C1P_["Muscle creeps behind a guard and sucker-punches him in the back of the head."]
 _A6_(["Car Thief and Muscle drag the unconscious guard out of the way."])
 _A6_R1_(["They finish moving the obstructing vehicle, undeterred by the blaring alarm."])
 _A6S_(["With their path cleared, the team scrambles into the car and speeds out of the lot."])
 _A6_R2_(["They finish moving the obstructing vehicle, undeterred by the blaring alarm."])
 _A6_R3_(["They finish moving the obstructing vehicle, undeterred by the blaring alarm."])
 _A3_C2F_["Muscle&#39;s poor handling sees her crash into another container."]
 _A3_6_(["The team scatters once more, certain the guards will investigate the noise."])
 _A3_C3_{"Following the guards, Imitator asks if they&#39;re drunk, claiming to hear nothing."}
 _A3_C3P_["One guard admits to being inebriated and begs Imitator not to tell his boss."]
 _A3_8_(["Imitator promises to keep quiet so long as they help him search the truck."])
 _A3_8_Cont_(["With the guards now occupied, the team is safe to resume its work."])
 _A3_9_(["Picklock examines the newly uncovered gate, discovering it to be padlocked."])
 _A1_C2F_["Muscle fails to breach the office, forcing the team to rethink its approach."]
 _A1_5_(["They agree to try the side entrance, ignoring the obvious risk."])
 _A1_6_(["Imitator attempts a diversion by walking over and flashing his badge."])
 _A1_7_(["Despite Imitator&#39;s effort, one of the guards sees the crew entering the office."])
 _A1_C3_{"Muscle and Car Thief dash out to confront the guards."}
 _A1_C3F_["Amid the fight, one guard breaks away and stops Picklock from escaping."]
 _A1F1_(["When reinforcements arrive, the crew are forced to flee and abandon their teammate."])
 _A5_C2P_["With his back turned, Muscle smashes the guard in the head with a wrench."]
 _A7_(["Muscle and Imitator haul the stunned guard out of the way."])
 _A7_1_(["Using all their might, the team hefts the vehicle aside, ignoring the blaring alarm."])
 _A7_2_(["Another guard arrives to investigate, drawn over by the cacophony of noise."])
 _A7_3_(["The guard spots his downed partner and scrambles into the forklift to cut the team off."])
 _A7_R1_(["Imitator steps out to block his path but is flattened by the container."])
 _A7_4_(["The guard sits frozen in shock as the team drives the supercar out of the pen."])
 _A7S_(["After rescuing their injured comrade, the team piles into the car and speeds away."])
 _A8_R1_(["Car Thief tries to leave but there&#39;s no one there to pull the gate aside."])
 _A1_C3P_["They engage the guards in a brawl, allowing the others to flee."]
 _A1F2_(["Having beaten the guards to a pulp, the rest of the crew is able to escape the lot."])
 _A7_R3_(["Imitator steps out to block his path but is flattened by the container."])
 _A3_C3F_["Provoked by this spurious accusation, the guards gang up on Imitator."]
 _A3_10_(["As the argument turns physical, the crew steps in to defend their teammate."])
 _A3_11_(["Realizing they&#39;re outnumbered, the guards retreat and call for help."])
 _A3F_(["With the real cops now surely on their way, the team is forced to abandon the mission."])
 _A2_C3F_["The guard, now suspicious, ignores the demand and finds the crew hiding in the office."]
 _A2_4_(["The team is forced to fight its way out past the infuriated security guard."])
 _A2_4_Cont_(["Muscle tackles the guard from behind, smashing his head on the ground."])
 _A2_5_(["The team tries to continue the mission but the guard&#39;s cries alert his colleagues."])
 _A2F_(["With the situation rapidly getting out of control, the team abandons the heist."])
 _A7_R2_(["Imitator steps out to block his path but is flattened by the container."])
 _A8_R2_(["Car Thief tries to leave but there&#39;s no one there to pull the gate aside."])

